Whatever bundled filter snapshot: provenance and licensing.

WHAT IS BUNDLED
- adaway-hosts.txt: the AdAway default blocklist, retrieved 2026-10-04 from
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AdAway/adaway.github.io/master/hosts.txt
  and shipped byte-identical. It blocks mobile ad and analytics providers
  in hosts-file form.
- whatever-extra.txt: a short list of our own rules (network and cosmetic)
  compiled after it.
- snapshot-version.txt: `adaway-2026-10-04`, the snapshot identifier the app
  records when it compiles.

LICENSE (adaway-hosts.txt)
The AdAway list states its own terms in its header: CC Attribution 3.0
(http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Attribution is given here,
in the file's preserved header, and in the app's Content Blocker settings
tab. whatever-extra.txt is our own work.

REDISTRIBUTION NOTE
This snapshot is converted on-device into WebKit content-blocker rules; the
hosts text itself is not re-served. Replacing it with a newer upstream
retrieval means swapping adaway-hosts.txt, updating snapshot-version.txt,
and refreshing this date.
